V8 gyp: trap-handler sources for the host half of a QNX build.

V8's trap-handler.h decides by the OS it is compiled on whether the wasm trap
handler exists (Linux on x64; the arm64 simulator on x64 Linux). The gyp
files add the matching sources by gyp's OS, which is the target's -- qnx --
for the host toolset too. The host build of V8 for a QNX target on a Linux
machine therefore compiled code that calls the trap handler without its
sources, and mksnapshot failed to link (undefined trap_handler::TryHandleSignal,
v8_internal_simulator_ProbeMemory). Add them for that host toolset.

Upstream-Status: QNX-specific

--- a/tools/v8_gypfiles/v8.gyp
+++ b/tools/v8_gypfiles/v8.gyp
@@ -1152,6 +1152,14 @@
             }],
             ['v8_enable_webassembly==1', {
               'conditions': [
+                # QNX: the host half of the build runs on Linux, and V8's code picks its
+                # trap handler by the OS it is compiled on, not by gyp's OS.
+                ['_toolset=="host" and OS=="qnx" and host_os=="linux"', {
+                  'sources': [
+                    '<(V8_ROOT)/src/trap-handler/handler-inside-posix.cc',
+                    '<(V8_ROOT)/src/trap-handler/handler-outside-posix.cc',
+                  ],
+                }],
                 ['OS in "linux mac ios freebsd openharmony"', {
                   'sources': [
                     '<(V8_ROOT)/src/trap-handler/handler-inside-posix.cc',
@@ -1192,6 +1200,15 @@
                     '<(V8_ROOT)/src/trap-handler/handler-outside-win.cc',
                   ],
                 }],
+                # QNX: the host half of the build runs on Linux, and V8's code picks its
+                # trap handler by the OS it is compiled on, not by gyp's OS.
+                ['_toolset=="host" and OS=="qnx" and host_os=="linux" and host_arch=="x64"', {
+                  'sources': [
+                    '<(V8_ROOT)/src/trap-handler/handler-inside-posix.cc',
+                    '<(V8_ROOT)/src/trap-handler/handler-outside-posix.cc',
+                    '<(V8_ROOT)/src/trap-handler/handler-outside-simulator.cc',
+                  ],
+                }],
                 ['(_toolset=="host" and host_arch=="x64" or _toolset=="target" and target_arch=="x64") and (OS in "linux mac win openharmony")', {
                   'sources': [
